  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a celebration of your favorite sport with this premium Softball Comforter Set from Jeminise. Designed for ultimate comfort and style, this bedding set is perfect for softball players, fans, and lovers alike, offering a cozy and decorative touch to any room.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Show your support for softball with a bedding set that celebrates the spirit of the game and its dedicated fans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm), offering an ultra-soft, smooth, durable, and fade-resistant feel that's also cool and breathable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit a variety of beds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes one high-quality comforter, perfect for a complete bedding refresh.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for convenience, this comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low (use a mesh laundry bag for best results).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection finishing techniques to prevent fading and smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Showcases a vibrant Softball Design 05 with a sport theme, adding a dynamic and relaxing feel to your room.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Durable, Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Recommended Uses for Product</th>\n<td>Napping, Reading, Travel</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
